# 64k-token rows on one node of 8 GPUs: a 3B mixture of experts in Qwen3-Next's shape,
# 3 Gated DeltaNet layers to every gated attention layer, with each row's positions
# split 8 ways (context parallelism). Attention passes its keys and values round the
# GPUs (ring), and the DeltaNets pass their recurrent state along (pass_state), so
# neither gathers a whole row onto a GPU. Each step's 8 rows go through one at a time.
#
#   bux plan   examples/experiments/parallel/long_context.bux
#   bux launch examples/experiments/parallel/long_context.bux
#
# Documents shorter than a row are still packed into it and see only themselves.
use qwen3_next
use fineweb_wsd

d_model = 1024
delta   = gdn(num_heads=8, num_v_heads=16, head_dim=128)
attn.num_heads      = 8
experts.num_experts = 64
experts.top_k       = 8
model = embed "DDDA"^6 norm @h out mtp

seq_len = 64k
batch   = 8                                 # 512k tokens a step

mesh      = mesh(context=8)
precision = precision(compute=bfloat16)
methods   = methods(attention=ring, recurrence=pass_state, repeat=scan, remat=full,
                    microbatches=8)
